Common Type Recognition [523]
    documentation 'Recognition given to the student for accomplishments in a co-curricular, or 
                  'extra-curricular activity.
    include Achievement [717]
        documentation 'An entity that includes information about achievement earned by a learner upon 
                      'fulfilling a specified criteria.
        is required
    enumeration RecognitionType [908]
        documentation 'The nature of recognition given to the student for accomplishments in a 
                      'co-curricular, or extra-curricular activity.
        is part of identity
    string RecognitionDescription [907]
        documentation 'A description of the type of academic distinctions earned by or awarded to the 
                      'individual.
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 80
    date RecognitionAwardDate [905]
        documentation 'The date the recognition was awarded or earned.
        is optional
    date RecognitionAwardExpiresDate [906]
        documentation 'Date on which the award expires.
        is optional